{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09053","headline":"寄大梁诸友 · 韦应物","name":"寄大梁诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分竹守南谯，弭节过梁池。\n雄都衆君子，出饯拥河湄。\n燕谑始云洽，方舟已解维。\n一爲风水便，但见山川驰。\n昨日次睢阳，今夕宿符离。\n云树怆重叠，烟波念还期。\n相敦在勤事，海内方劳师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}